cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or implement the SHOW Standard, please cite it as below."
title: "The SHOW Standard"
abstract: "S·H·O·W — Content Classification Standard for Narrative and Creative Works. A four-axis content rating (Spice, Heat, OMG, WTF) for books, audio, film, and interactive narrative. Each axis is fully independent; specific content types are communicated through content tags. Companion to the VEIL Standard (generation authorisation) and the SCRIPTS Standard (experience rating)."
